comments.body:
@reporter what exactly do you mean by "implementation is efficient, meaning that it doesn't require to full-scan the collection if we want to retrieve points with high offset/min/max values"?
Correct me If I'm wrong but if I want to read the index sorted by payload key, well, I have to at least one sort the index requiring a full scan.
You could cash the result for further paginations but, I don't, see how this can be achieved differently.
